hadiths[47]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1396","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Baqi mein aik mard ne aik mard ko pukara: Ae Abul Qasim! To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ki taraf mutawajjah hue. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak main ne Aap ko nahi pukara, main ne falan ko pukara hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kuniyat par kuniyat na rakho. (Muslim: 6/169). Baab: Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke naam par naam rakhna."
"1397","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham mein se aik mard ke han larka paida hua to us ne us ka naam Muhammad rakha. To us ki qaum ne us se kaha: Ham tumhein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke naam par naam rakhnay nahi dein ge. To wo apne betay ko apni peeth par utha kar le gaya aur usay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mere han larka paida hua hai to main ne us ka naam Muhammad rakha. To meri qaum ne mujh se kaha: Ham tumhein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke naam par naam rakhnay nahi dein ge. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kuniyat par kuniyat na rakho, beshak main taqseem karnay wala hun, tum mein taqseem karta hun. (Muslim: 6/169). Baab: Allah Taala ke nazdeek pasandeeda naam: Abdullah aur Abdur Rahman."
"1398","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke nazdeek tumharay naamon mein se pasandeeda Abdullah aur Abdur Rahman hain. (Muslim: 6/169). Baab: Naumaulood ka naam Abdur Rahman rakhna."
"1399","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham mein se aik mard ke han larka paida hua to us ne us ka naam Qasim rakha. To ham ne kaha: Ham tumhein Abul Qasim ki kuniyat nahi dein ge aur na tumhari aankh thandi karein ge. To wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se ye zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne betay ka naam Abdur Rahman rakho. (Muslim: 6/171). Baab: Naumaulood ka naam Abdullah rakhna, usay (ghutti dena) aur us par namaz."
"1400","[AI-translation] Urwa bin Zubair aur Fatima bint Munzir bin Zubair se riwayat hai ke un donon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ki beti Asma hijrat kar ke niklin jabke wo Abdullah bin Zubair se hamila thin. To wo Quba pahunchin aur Quba mein Abdullah ki wiladat hui. Phir wiladat ke baad wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas niklin taake Aap us ki tehneek karein. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay un se liya aur apni god mein rakha, phir khajoor mangwai. Ummul Momineen Aisha Siddiqa (raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke ham ne dair tak khajoor talash ki, phir aakhir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khajoor chabayi aur us ka ras us ke munh mein dala. Sab se pehli cheez jo Abdullah ke pait mein dakhil hui wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka luaab tha. Sayyida Asma (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke is ke baad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abdullah par haath phera, us ke liye dua ki aur us ka naam Abdullah rakha. Phir jab wo saat aath saal ke hue to Zubair (raziyallahu anhu) ke ishare par wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas bai'at ke liye aaye. Jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein aatay dekha to muskuraye. Phir un se bai'at li, barkat ke liye kyunke wo bachay thay. (Muslim)."
"1401","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Talha ka beta beemar tha. To Abu Talha niklay aur bacha faut ho gaya. Phir jab Abu Talha wapas aaye to kaha: Mere betay ne kya kiya? To Umm Sulaim ne kaha: Wo pehle se zyada sukoon mein hai. To unhon ne un ke paas shaam ka khana qareeb kiya. To unhon ne khana khaya, phir un se milay. Phir jab farigh hue to unhon ne kaha: Bachay ko dafan karo. Phir jab Abu Talha subah hue to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne aaj raat dulha ki tarah guzari? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Un donon ko barkat de. To un ke han larka paida hua. To mujh se Abu Talha ne kaha: Usay uthao yahan tak ke usay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas lao. To wo usay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laye aur us ke saath khajoorein bhejin. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay liya aur farmaya: Kya us ke saath kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, khajoorein. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein liya aur chabaya, phir usay apne munh se le kar bachay ke munh mein rakha, phir us ki tehneek ki aur us ka naam Abdullah rakha. (Muslim: 6/174-175). Baab: Ambiya aur nekiyon ke naamon par naam rakhna."
"1402","[AI-translation] Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab main Najran aaya to unhon ne mujh se poocha aur kaha: Beshak tum padhtay ho: Ae Haroon ki behan, jabke Musa Isa se itnay itnay pehle thay. Phir jab main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya to main ne Aap se is ke baaray mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo apne se pehle ambiya aur nekiyon ke naamon par naam rakhtay thay. (Muslim: 6/171). Baab: Naumaulood ka naam Ibrahim rakhna."
"1403","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere han larka paida hua to main usay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya. To Aap ne us ka naam Ibrahim rakha aur khajoor se us ki tehneek ki. (Muslim: 6/175). Baab: Naumaulood ka naam Munzir rakhna."
"1404","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usaid ke betay Munzir ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya gaya jab wo paida hue. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay apni raan par rakha jabke Abu Usaid baithay hue thay. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne saamnay kisi cheez mein mashghool ho gaye. To Abu Usaid ne apne betay ke baaray mein hukm diya aur usay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki raan se utha liya gaya aur usay wapas kar diya gaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hosh mein aaye aur farmaya: Bacha kahan hai? To Abu Usaid ne kaha: Ham ne usay wapas kar diya, Ae Allah ke Rasool! To Aap ne farmaya: Us ka naam kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Falan, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke us ka naam Munzir hai. To us din us ka naam Munzir rakha. (Muslim: 6/176). (Aqlabna se murad wapas karna hai, kam mashhoor lughat hai.)"
"1405","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ki aik beti thi jinhein Aasiya kaha jata tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka naam Jameela rakha. (Muslim: 6/173). Baab: Barra ka naam Juwayriya rakhna."
"1406","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Juwayriya ka naam Barra tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka naam Juwayriya kar diya, aur Aap napasand kartay thay ke kaha jaye ke Barra ke paas se nikla. (Muslim: 6/173). Baab: Barra ka naam Zainab rakhna."
"1407","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Amr bin Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne apni beti ka naam Barra rakha. To mujh se Zainab bint Abu Salama ne kaha: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is naam se mana farmaya hai, aur mera naam Barra rakha gaya tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne aap ko paak na batlao, Allah tum mein se parhezgaron ko zyada janta hai. To unhon ne kaha: Ham us ka kya naam rakhein? Aap ne farmaya: Us ka naam Zainab rakho. (Muslim: 6/173-174). Baab: Angoor ka naam karam rakhna."
"1408","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi angoor ko karam na kahay. Beshak karam Musalman mard hai. (Muslim: 7/46). (Mumaniat ki wajah ye hai ke Arab angoor ko karam kehtay thay is khayal se ke sharab peenay walay ko sakhi banati hai; sharab haraam honay ke baad Aap ne sharab ki tehqeer ke liye is se mana farmaya.)"
"1409","[AI-translation] Wail bin Hujr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Karam na kaho, lekin angoor aur rassi kaho. (Muslim: 7/46). Baab: Aflah, Rabah, Yasar, Nafi naam rakhnay se mumaniat."
"1410","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein mana farmaya ke ham apne ghulamon ke naam in chaar naamon par rakhein: Aflah, Rabah, Yasar, Nafi. (Muslim: 6/172)"
"1411","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ko pasandeeda kalaam chaar hain: SubhanAllah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar. Tum in mein se jis se shuru karo tumhein nuqsan na hoga. Aur apne ghulam ka naam Yasar, Rabah, Nujaih, yani Aflah ke mani mein, ya Aflah na rakho, kyunke agar tum poocho ke kya wo hai? Aur wo wahan na ho to kaha jaye ga: Wo yahan nahi. Ye sirf chaar hain, mere liye un par zyada na karo. (Muslim). (Ahmad ne Samura se doosri sanad se riwayat ki ke jab main tumhein hadees bayan karun to us par zyada na karo, aur farmaya ke chaar achi baton mein se, wo Quran mein se hain; ye riwayat dalalat karti hai ke hadees ke aakhir mein ye qaul Nabi tak marfu hai, rawi ka qaul nahi.)"
"1412","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne irada kiya ke Yala, Baraka, Aflah, Yasar, Nafi aur is jaisay naamon se manay karein. Phir main ne Aap ko dekha ke Aap us ke baad us se khamosh ho gaye aur kuch na farmaya. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) wafaat paa gaye aur Aap ne is se manay nahi farmaya. Phir Umar ne is se manay karnay ka irada kiya phir usay chhor diya. (Muslim: 6/172). Baab: Ghulam, londi, aaqa aur sardar ka naam rakhna."
"1413","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi na kahay: Apne Rab ko pilao, apne Rab ko khilao, apne Rab ko wuzu karao. Aur tum mein se koi na kahay: Mera Rab. Aur wo kahay: Mera sardar, mera aaqa. Aur tum mein se koi na kahay: Mera ghulam, meri londi. Aur wo kahay: Mera larka, meri larki, mera ghulam. (Muslim: 7/47). Baab: Chotay bachay ki kuniyat rakhna."
"1414","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon mein sab se achay akhlaq walay thay. Aur mera aik bhai tha jinhein Abu Umair kaha jata tha. Unhon ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke unhon ne kaha ke wo doodh chhura chuka tha. Unhon ne kaha: To jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aatay aur usay dekhtay to farmatay: Ae Abu Umair! Nughair ne kya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: To wo us se kheltay thay. (Muslim: 6/176-177). Baab: Aadmi ka aadmi se Ae betay kehna. (Nughair noon ke pesh aur ain ke zabar ke saath naghr ki tasgheer hai, wo chota parinda hai.)"
"1415","[AI-translation] Mughira bin Shuba (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Dajjal ke baaray mein kisi ne itna sawal nahi kiya jitna main ne Aap se poocha. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae betay! Tumhein us se kya takleef hai? Beshak wo tumhein nuqsan nahi pahunchaye ga. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Wo guman kartay hain ke us ke saath pani ki nehrein aur roti ke pahar hain. Aap ne farmaya: Wo Allah par is se halka hai. (Muslim: 6/177). Baab: Allah ke nazdeek badtareen naam jo Shahanshah kehlaye."
"1416","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke nazdeek badtareen naam us mard ka hai jis ne Malik-ul-Amlaak naam rakha. Aik riwayat ke lafz hain ke qayamat ke din Allah par sab se zyada ghussa wala aur sab se khabees mard. Sufyan, yani Ibn Uyaina ne kaha ke Malik-ul-Amlaak Shahanshah jaisa hai. Aur Ahmad bin Hanbal ne kaha: Main ne Abu Amr se akhna ke mani poocho to unhon ne kaha ke us se murad sab se zaleel hai. (Muslim)."
"1417","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye us ke bhai par paanch (huqooq) wajib hain: Salam ka jawab dena, chheenk nay walay ko dua dena, dawat qabool karna, beemar ki iyadat karna aur janazon ke peechay chalna. (Muslim: 7/2)"
"1418","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ka Musalman par chhe haq hain. Kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum us se milo to usay salam karo, jab wo tumhein bulaye to usay qabool karo, jab wo tum se mashwara mangay to usay mashwara do, jab wo chheenke aur Allah ki hamd karay to usay dua do, jab wo beemar ho to us ki iyadat karo, aur jab wo mar jaye to us ke peechay chalo. (Muslim: 7/3). Baab: Raston mein baithnay se mumaniat aur rastay ka haq dena."
"1419","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Raston mein baithnay se bacho. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Hamaray liye hamari majlison ke siwa chara nahi, ham un mein baatein kartay hain. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Phir agar tum majlis ke siwa inkar kartay ho to rastay ka haq do. Unhon ne kaha: Aur us ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nigaah jhukana, takleef rokna, salam ka jawab dena, neki ka hukm dena aur burai se manay karna. (Muslim: 7/3). Baab: Sawar ka paidal par aur thoray ka zyada par salam."
"1420","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sawar paidal ko salam karay, paidal baithay hue ko salam karay, aur thoray zyada ko salam karein. (Muslim: 7/2). Baab: Ijazat maangna aur salam."
"1421","[AI-translation] Abu Burda se, Abu Musa Ash'ari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Musa Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaye aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum, ye Abdullah bin Qais hai. To unhon ne unhein ijazat na di. To unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, ye Abu Musa hai. Assalamu alaikum, ye Ash'ari hai. Phir wapas chalay gaye. To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere paas wapas lao, mujhe mere paas wapas lao. To wo aaye. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Abu Musa! Tumhein kis ne wapas kiya? Ham kaam mein thay. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Ijazat teen baar hai, agar tumhein ijazat di jaye warna wapas jao. Unhon ne kaha: Tum is par mere paas gawah zaroor lao ge warna main ne kiya aur kiya. Asal fa'altu fa'altu hai, Muslim se tasheeh hai. To Abu Musa gaye. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Agar wo gawah paye to tum usay shaam ko mimbar ke paas pao ge, agar wo gawah na paye to tum usay na pao ge. Phir jab shaam ko aaye to unhon ne usay paya. To Umar ne kaha: Ae Abu Musa! Tum kya kehtay ho, kya tum ne gawah paya? Us ne kaha: Haan, Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) haazir hain. To Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Beshak wo mo'tabar hai. To Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Abut Tufail! Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) kya kehtay hain? To Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna, phir unhon ne Abu Musa ki taeed ki aur kaha: Ae Ibn Khattab! Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba par azaab na bano. To Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Jab main ne hadees suni to main ne usay tehqeeq karna behtar samjha. (Muslim). (Is riwayat ke lafz hain ke qayamat ke din Allah par sab se zyada ghussa wala mard.)"
"1422","[AI-translation] Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere paas tumhari ijazat ye hai ke parda uthaya jaye aur tum meri sarghoshi suno yahan tak ke main tumhein manay karun. Asal mein hai ke suno, Muslim mein hai ke ghaur se suno. (Muslim: 7/6). Baab: Ijazat maangtay waqt main kehna napasand hona. (Siwad se murad raaz aur sarghoshi hai.)"
"1423","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ijazat maangi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? To main ne kaha: Main. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main, main. Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke goya Aap ne usay napasand kiya. (Muslim: 6/180). Baab: Ijazat maangtay waqt jhanknay se mumaniat."
"1424","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik mard ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darwazay ke suraakh mein jhanka jabke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas kanghi thi jis se Aap apna sar khujatay thay. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay dekha to farmaya: Agar main janta ke tum mera intezar kartay ho to main isay tumhari aankh mein chubho deta. Asal tantaziruni hai, Muslim ke aik nuskhay mein bhi aisa hai. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ijazat to aankh ki wajah se rakhi gayi hai. (Muslim: 6/181). Baab: Jo qaum ke ghar mein baghair ijazat jhankay aur wo us ki aankh phor dein. (Midra lohay ki kanghi hai jis se sar ke baal sanwaray jatay hain.)"
"1425","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar koi mard tum par baghair ijazat jhankay aur tum usay kankari se maaro aur us ki aankh phor do to tum par koi gunah nahi. (Muslim: 6/181). Baab: Achanak nazar aur us se nazar phernay ke baaray mein."
"1426","[AI-translation] Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se achanak nazar ke baaray mein poocha. To Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke main apni nazar pher lun. (Muslim: 6/182). (Asal mein hai ke suno, Muslim mein hai ke ghaur se suno; siwad se murad raaz hai; midra lohay ki kanghi hai; asal tantaziruni hai.)"
"1427","[AI-translation] Abu Waqid Laisi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jabke Aap masjid mein baithay thay aur log Aap ke saath thay ke teen afraad ka giroh aaya. To do Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf aaye aur aik chala gaya. Unhon ne kaha: To donon Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas khaday hue. To un mein se aik ne halqay mein jagah dekhi aur us mein baith gaya, aur doosra un ke peechay baith gaya, aur teesra peeth pher kar chala gaya. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farigh hue to farmaya: Kya main tumhein teen afraad ke baaray mein na bataun? Raha un mein se aik, to wo Allah ki taraf aaya to Allah ne usay jagah di. Aur raha doosra, to us ne sharam ki to Allah ne us se sharam ki. Aur raha doosra, to us ne munh phera to Allah ne us se munh pher liya. (Muslim: 7/9). Baab: Aadmi ko us ki jagah se utha kar us mein baithnay se mumaniat."
"1428","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi aadmi ko us ki jagah se na uthaye phir us mein baithay, lekin kushada ho jao aur wusat karo. Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke main ne kaha: Juma ke din? Aap ne farmaya: Juma ke din aur us ke siwa. Aur Ibn Umar jab un ke liye un ki jagah se koi mard khada hota to us mein na baithtay thay. (Muslim: 7/10). Baab: Jab apni majlis se uthay phir wapas aaye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai. (Abu Huraira ki marfu riwayat aayi hai ke aadmi aadmi ke liye apni jagah se na uthay, is ki sanad hasan hai.)"
"1429","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni majlis se uthay, aur Abu Awana ki hadees mein hai ke jo apni majlis se uthay phir us ki taraf wapas aaye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai. (Muslim: 7/10). Baab: Teesray ke siwa do ke sarghoshi karnay se mumaniat."
"1430","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum teen ho to do teesray ke siwa sarghoshi na karein yahan tak ke tum logon se mil jao, is liye ke wo usay ghamgeen karay gi. (Muslim: 7/13). Baab: Bachon ko salam karna."
"1431","[AI-translation] Sayyar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Sabit Bunani ke saath chal raha tha. To wo bachon ke paas se guzray aur unhein salam kiya. To Sabit ne bayan kiya ke wo Anas ke saath chal rahay thay. To wo bachon ke paas se guzray aur unhein salam kiya. Aur Anas ne bayan kiya ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath chal rahay thay. To Aap bachon ke paas se guzray aur unhein salam kiya. Muslim mein hai ke aur bayan kiya. (Muslim: 7/6). (Abu Huraira ki marfu riwayat aayi hai, is ki sanad hasan hai.)"
"1432","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Yahud aur Nasara ko salam mein pehal na karo. Muslim mein hai ke phir jab. Aur jab tum un mein se kisi se rastay mein milo to usay us ke tang hissay ki taraf majboor karo. (Muslim: 7/5). Baab: Kitab walon ko jawab dena."
"1433","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahud mein se kuch logon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam kiya aur kaha: Tum par maut ho, Ae Abul Qasim! To Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum par. To Aisha ghussa huin aur kaha: Kya tum ne nahi suna unhon ne kya kaha? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi, main ne suna aur unhein jawab diya. Aur beshak hamari dua un par qabool hoti hai aur un ki dua ham par qabool nahi hoti. (Muslim: 7/5). Baab: Hijab naazil honay ke baad auraton ke nikalnay se manay karna."
"1434","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj raat ko nikalti thin jab wo qaza-e-haajat ke liye Manasi ki taraf jatin, aur wo khula maidan hai. Aur Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kehtay thay: Apni biwiyon se parda karaiye. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) na kartay thay. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Sauda bint Zama raat ko isha ke waqt niklin jabke wo lambi aurat thin. To Umar ne unhein pukara: Khabardar! Ham ne tumhein pehchan liya, Ae Sauda! Hijab naazil honay ki hirs mein. Aisha ne kaha: To Allah Taala ne hijab naazil farmaya, Muslim ka izafa hai. (Muslim: 7/7). Baab: Auraton ko apni haajat ke liye nikalnay ki ijazat. (Manasi khula maidan hai.)"
"1435","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sauda (raziyallahu anha) ham par hijab lagaye janay ke baad apni haajat poori karnay ke liye niklin, Muslim mein hai ke un par. Aur wo bhari jism wali aurat thin jo jism mein auraton se buland thin, jo unhein pehchanta us par wo chhupi na rehtin. To unhein Umar bin Khattab ne dekha aur kaha: Ae Sauda! Allah ki qasam tum ham se nahi chhupteen. Dekho tum kaisay nikalti ho. Unhon ne kaha: To wo wapas laut aayin jabke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere ghar mein thay aur Aap shaam ka khana kha rahay thay jabke Aap ke haath mein haddi thi. To wo dakhil huin aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak main nikli to mujh se Umar ne aisa aisa kaha. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap par wahi naazil hui phir Aap se utha li gayi jabke haddi Aap ke haath mein thi, Aap ne usay nahi rakha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhein ijazat di gayi hai ke tum apni haajat ke liye niklo. (Muslim: 7/6). (Fara se murad buland hona hai.)"
"1436","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Zubair ne nikah kiya jabke zameen mein un ka koi maal, ghulam ya us ke siwa kuch na tha, siwae un ke ghoday ke. Unhon ne kaha: To main un ke ghoday ko chaara dalti, un ki kifayat karti, us ki dekh bhaal karti, un ke paani bhar nay walay oont ke liye guthliyan koot-ti, usay chaara dalti, pani bharti, us ke baray dol ko seeti aur aata gondhti. Aur main roti pakana achi tarah na janti thi. To Ansaar ki parosan aurtein mere liye roti pakatin, aur wo sachi aurtein thin. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main Zubair ki zameen se guthliyan apne sar par uthati thi jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein ata ki thi, aur wo do tihai farsakh par thi. Unhon ne kaha: To main aik din aayi jabke guthliyan mere sar par thin. To mujh se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) milay jabke Aap ke saath Aap ke sahaba mein se chand afraad thay. To Aap ne mujhe bulaya phir farmaya: Ikh ikh, taake mujhe apne peechay bithayein. Unhon ne kaha: To main sharmayi aur tumhari ghairat ko pehchana. To Zubair ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tumhara apne sar par guthliyan uthana mere saath sawari karnay se zyada sakht hai. Unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke us ke baad Abu Bakr ne meri taraf khadima bheji. To us ne mujhe ghoday ki dekh bhaal se kaafi kar diya. To goya us ne mujhe azaad kar diya. (Muslim: 7/11-12). Baab: Jab mard ke saath aurat ho to wo kahay ke ye falan hai. (Gharb baray dol ko kehtay hain.)"
"1437","[AI-translation] Safiyya bint Huyay (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) etikaf mein thay. To main Aap ki ziyarat ko raat ko aayi aur Aap se baat ki. Phir main wapas janay ke liye khari hui to Aap mere saath khaday hue taake mujhe wapas chhorein. Aur un ka maskan Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) ke ghar mein tha. To Ansaar ke do mard guzray. Phir jab unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha to tez ho gaye. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aahista chalo, beshak ye Safiyya bint Huyay hain. To unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Beshak shaitaan insan se khoon ki tarah daudta hai, aur beshak mujhe khauf hua ke wo tumharay dilon mein shar daal de, ya Aap ne farmaya ke koi cheez. (Muslim: 7/8). Baab: Mard ka ghair mahram aurat ke paas raat guzarnay se mumaniat."
"1438","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar! Koi mard bewah aurat ke paas raat na guzaray siwae is ke ke wo nikah karnay wala ho ya mahram ho. (Muslim: 7/7). (Sayyib ka zikr is liye hai kyunke aksar us ke paas jaya jata hai, kunwari aam taur par mehfooz hai, ye ba-darja-e-aula hai; nakih se murad dakhil honay wala shohar hai.)"
"1439","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Auraton par dakhil honay se bacho. To Ansaar mein se aik mard ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Dewar ke baaray mein kya kehtay hain? Aap ne farmaya: Dewar maut hai. Lais bin Sa'd ne kaha: Dewar shohar ka bhai hai aur shohar ke rishtadaron mein se us jaisa, chachazaad aur us jaisa. (Muslim: 7/7). Baab: Chhupi dulhan waliyon par dakhil honay se mumaniat."
"1440","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Banu Hashim ke chand afraad Asma bint Umais ke paas dakhil hue jabke wo Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thin. To unhon ne unhein dekha aur un ka aana bura jana. Phir unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya aur kaha ke main ne koi buri baat nahi dekhi. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne Asma ko buray kaam se paak kiya hai. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mimbar par khaday hue aur farmaya: Aaj ke baad koi shakhs us aurat ke ghar mein dakhil na ho jis ka shohar ghair haazir ho siwae is ke ke aik ya do mard us ke saath hon. (Muslim). (Mugheeba wo hai jis ka shohar ghar mein ghair haazir ho; apne mardon se murad wohi hain jin ke baaray mein fahisha aurat ke paas janay ka guman namumkin ho.)"
"1441","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj ke paas mukhannas aata jata tha. To wo usay un mein shumar kartay thay jinhein (auraton ki) haajat nahi. Unhon ne kaha: To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik din dakhil hue jabke wo Aap ki baaz biwiyon ke paas tha aur wo aik aurat ki sifat bayan kar raha tha. Us ne kaha: Jab wo aati hai to chaar se aati hai aur jab jaati hai to aath se jaati hai. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya main nahi dekhta ke ye janta hai jo yahan hai? Wo tum par dakhil na ho. Asal mein alaikum hai. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne usay parda kara diya. (Muslim: 7/11). Baab: Sonay par aag bujhana. (Mukhannas wo hai jo auraton se akhlaq, kalaam aur harkat mein mushabihat rakhta ho; kabhi ye paidaishi hota hai aur kabhi takalluf se, yahan doosra murad hai; chaar o aath se murad pait ki tehhein hain.)"
"1442","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Madina mein raat ko aik ghar apne ghar walon sameet jal gaya. Phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un ki khabar di gayi to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye aag tumhari dushman hai. To jab tum so jao to usay bujha do. (Muslim: 6/107). (Mugheeba wo hai jis ka shohar ghair haazir ho.)"
